5_Project_History/backups/

# Kam's chat log is DERIVED from the per-agent streams (Phase 0, 2026-09-08).
# Tracking a generated file that two seats both regenerate is what corrupted it
# three times in one morning. The RECORD is tracked — chat_legacy.json (frozen)
# plus one stream per writer; this file is rebuilt by tools/chat_streams.py at
# every append, at every safe_push, and at every boot by doctor.sh.
0_Brain/dashboard/data/chat_log.json

# Files Kam drags into the chat (2026-09-08). His working material — screenshots,
# PDFs, exports — not repo content, and some of it is large. Gitignored AT CREATION.
# The chat entry keeps the absolute path, so Wednesday reads them from disk; they
# are not recoverable from git and are not meant to be.
0_Brain/dashboard/uploads/
